<html lang='ko'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <title>위임자 변경 알림 / Delegator Change Notification</title>
    <style>
      body{ font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', Arial, sans-serif;
      background:#f4f4f4;margin:0;padding:0;color:#333; line-height:1.6; }
      .container{ max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;
      border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08); } .header{
      background:#17a2b8; color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:30px 20px;
      border-radius:8px 8px 0 0; } .header h1{margin:0;font-size:24px;} .header
      h2{margin:8px 0 0 0;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;} .content{padding:30px
      20px;} .org-info{
      background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0;
      border-left:4px solid #17a2b8; } .org-info h3{ margin:10px
      0;color:#17a2b8;font-size:18px; } .delegator-change{
      background:#e8f4f8;padding:20px;border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0;
      border-left:4px solid #17a2b8; } .delegator-item{ margin:15px
      0;padding:15px;background:#fff;border-radius:4px; border-left:4px solid
      #28a745; } .delegator-item.previous{ border-left-color:#dc3545;
      background:#fff5f5; } .delegator-item strong{
      display:block;margin-bottom:8px; } .delegator-item.previous strong{
      color:#dc3545; } .delegator-item:not(.previous) strong{ color:#28a745; }
      .change-info{ font-size:14px;color:#6c757d;margin-top:15px;
      padding:15px;background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:4px; } .footer{
      background:#f8f9fa;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;
      padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#6c757d;
      border-radius:0 0 8px 8px; } .highlight{ color:#17a2b8;font-weight:600; }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .container{margin:10px;border-radius:4px;} .header{padding:20px 15px;}
      .content{padding:20px 15px;} }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <!-- ─── 헤더 ─── -->
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>🔄 위임자 변경 알림</h1>
        <h2>Delegator Change Notification</h2>
        <p style='margin-top:18px'>
          조직의 위임자가 변경되었습니다.<br />
          The organization's delegator has been changed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- ─── 본문 ─── -->
      <div class='content'>
        <!-- 조직 정보 -->
        <div class='org-info'>
          <strong>🏢 조직 정보 / Organization Information</strong>
          <h3>{{organization.name}}</h3>
        </div>

        <!-- 위임자 변경 정보 -->
        <div class='delegator-change'>
          <strong>👥 위임자 변경 내역 / Delegator Changes</strong>

          <div class='delegator-item previous'>
            <strong>❌ 이전 위임자 / Previous Delegator</strong>
            <p style='margin:8px 0;'>
              <strong>{{organization.delegator.studentNumber}}
                {{organization.delegator.nameKr}}</strong><br />
              <span
                style='color:#6c757d;'
              >{{organization.delegator.email}}</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class='delegator-item'>
            <strong>✅ 새로운 위임자 / New Delegator</strong>
            <p style='margin:8px 0;'>
              <strong>{{user.studentNumber}} {{user.nameKr}}</strong><br />
              <span style='color:#6c757d;'>{{user.email}}</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='change-info'>
          <p style='margin:0;'><strong>📢 안내사항:</strong></p>
          <p style='margin:8px 0 0 0;'>위임자 변경이 즉시 적용되었습니다. 새로운
            위임자는 조직 관리 권한을 부여받습니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ─── 푸터 ─── -->
      <div class='footer'>
        <p><strong>학생문화공간위원회 / Student Cultural Space Committee</strong></p>
        <p>위임자 변경을 알려드립니다.<br />
          We are notifying you of the delegator change.</p>
        <p>문의사항이 있으시면 언제든 연락해 주세요.<br />
          Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>